<title>USA: Thiokol Corp to buy back up to 1.5 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Thiokol Corp to buy back up to 1.5 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>OGDEN, Utah 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thiokol Corp on Thursday said its directors authorized the company to buy back up to 1.5 million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The repurchase program, which replaces existing authorizations, allows the company to buy stock through the open market and privately negotiated transactions, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Thiokol Corp is a producer of solid propulsion systems, ordnance and composite products.</p>
</text>
